"Installationsskript am Ende an; er steht außerdem als SETUP_BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN "
"in der Datei .env."
msgstr ""
"The code protects the first setup. On the Raspberry Pi the installation "
"script shows it at the end; it is also stored as SETUP_BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN in "
"the .env file."

#: templates/core/terminal_admin.html:23
